      "text": "Christ’s sacrifice answers ends of law unto all who have broken heart and contrite spirit, 2 Ne. 2:7. may gates of hell be shut before me, because my heart is broken and spirit is contrite, 2 Ne. 4:32. Jacob2 must tell people of wickedness in presence of the broken heart, Jacob 2:10. offer for sacrifice unto the Lord broken heart and contrite spirit, 3 Ne. 9:20. come unto Christ with broken heart and contrite spirit, 3 Ne. 12:19. Nephites do not come unto Jesus with broken heart and contrite spirits, Morm. 2:14. call upon the Father with broken heart and contrite spirit, Ether 4:15. only those with broken heart and contrite spirit are received unto baptism, Moro. 6:2.",
